  "prefLabel": "He-W 577.02 Recipient Eligibility",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 577.02 Recipient Eligibility. All medicaid recipients shall be eligible for laboratory services, in accordance with He-W 577.\n\nSource. #8564, eff 2-7-06; ss by #10513, eff 1-24-14; ss by #14414, eff 10-22-2025, EXPIRES: 10-22-2035",
